{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic cooperative space simulator where four players control captains in a specific role. Unfortunately, the space corp you are a part is limited in operational space, so each captain much share their instruments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four roles to specialize in: Helm, Communications, Engineering, and Weapons. Each role serves a purpose in proper operation of a Starship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your panel at anytime can be covered by another player, so you must work together and communicate effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine for materials, take on objectives, destroy other ships, or just joyride your ship. Your imagination is the limiting factor.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664990?t=1772493091","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664990?t=1772493091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664990/bcfa6636ac9dec9d8fb93fd2493e4cbdfdd6b1e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772493091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664990/bcfa6636ac9dec9d8fb93fd2493e4cbdfdd6b1e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772493091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic cooperative space simulator where four players control captains in a specific role. Unfortunately, the space corp you a